 the bound object is given without an extended"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"class definition (SCClassDefinition), then cells will only be generated for properties of type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"NSString and NSNumber, and will be either of type SCTextFieldCell or SCNumericTextFieldCell,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"respectively. If an SCClassDefinition is provided for the bound object, a full fledged"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"section of cells will be generated."}],"title":"SCObjectSection","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scobjectsection","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SCObjectSection"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCObjectSection","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCTableViewController/objectForSection:atIndex:":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This method should be implemented by SCTableViewController subclasses that wish to provide data source object to an SCObjectSection that has been created in Interface Builder."}],"title":"objectForSection:atIndex:","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/sctableviewcontroller\/objectforsection:atindex:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"objectForSection:atIndex:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCTableViewController\/objectForSection:atIndex:","type":"topic"}}}